OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers say 550-home scheme
OL,4,Arisks urban sprawl
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in neighbouring villages
OL,7,Fto a coastal town worry a 550-home
OL,8,Festate will create "urban sprawl" in
OL,9,Ftheir communities.
OL,11,FPlans for the scheme on the outskirts
OL,12,Fof Cromer have been recommended to be
OL,13,Fapproved at a North Norfolk District
OL,14,FCouncil planning meeting on Thursday.
OL,16,FBut Roughton Parish Council is among
OL,17,Fthe 155 objectors opposing the project
OL,18,Fand have called it "unacceptable" as it
OL,19,Fwill encroach upon the rural
OL,20,Fenvironment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
